NLQmode,andthenextoneturnsitbackon.


Å5.D  NLQItalicOff


5.E  DraftLightOn


5.F  DraftLightOff


5.10 NLQLightOn
Ä
(Nondaisywheel)InourLX-80configurationfile,wemake
"Light"textappearinanon-NLQfount.


Å5.11 NLQLightOff


5.12 DraftSuperscriptOnÄ

Forcorrectjustificationoftext,superscriptandsubscript
charactersshouldbethesamewidthasnormaltext.Usea
halflinefeedondaisywheelprinters.


